    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JAPAN\nKirant\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailso\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin VodkaRum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nf Hi 179\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nH*At\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\n* 0-1I E-\u003e\nLamb Curry with Chutney\nFillets of Sole Meunière\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nhicken. Ves did celery in a spritely sauce",
      "Fillets of Sole Meunière\nT7804=IN\nChicken Verdi\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nRice Pilaf\nPotatoes Maison\n*= r\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nTossed Garden Salad\nSelection of Fruits and Cheeses\nDessert\nCoffee\nJ-E-\nTea\n*I *\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie Amaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n146.KJ422",
      "JAPAN\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nJAPAN is a land of contrasts. It can display the most neon-lit, skyscrapered and expressway-lined\nface, vet finds its inspiration in the quiet beauty of the graceful Tori Gate and Mt. Fuji, pictured here\nThe Japanese can run their trains at liahtenina speed, vet spend hours on a small conversationa\ncourtesy. Here you will find graceful perfection and formality contrasted with vigorous commerce\nAmong the many stylish hotels in the capital city of Tokyo is the Keio Plaza Inter-Continental\nPan Am serves Tokyo on its Round-The-World flights and nonstop daily from New York, San Francisco\na names come on Hon on sk i sed nonstop from Honou\nØPAN AM\n2010.011,004"
